{"id":"9879f6d31a4e6ad6","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-zfc-topo10-hausdorff-pair-separation.md","title":"ZFC Topo10 Hausdorff Pair Separation","display":"df-zfc-topo10-hausdorff-pair-separation — ZFC Topo10 Hausdorff Pair Separation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-topo10-hausdorff-pair-separation","aliases":["58-df-zfc-topo10-hausdorff-pair-separation"],"display":"df-zfc-topo10-hausdorff-pair-separation — ZFC Topo10 Hausdorff Pair Separation","depends_on":["[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-topo10-hausdorff-pair-separation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-topo10-hausdorff-pair-separation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-topo10-hausdorff-pair-separation — ZFC Topo10 Hausdorff Pair Separation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"74086485fba8d86f\" href=\"?note=74086485fba8d86f\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau,x,y,U,V\\in V\">\\(X,\\tau,x,y,U,V\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\\)</span> (topological-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"74086485fba8d86f\" href=\"?note=74086485fba8d86f\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo10HausdorffPairSeparation}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopo10HausdorffPairSeparation}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo10\\text{-}hausdorff\\text{-}pair\\text{-}separation} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTopo10HausdorffPairSeparation}_S(X,\\tau,x,y)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land x\\in X\\land y\\in X\\land x\\neq y\\land\\exists U\\in\\tau\\;\\exists V\\in\\tau\\;(x\\in U\\land y\\in V\\land U\\cap V=\\emptyset)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo10\\text{-}hausdorff\\text{-}pair\\text{-}separation} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTopo10HausdorffPairSeparation}_S(X,\\tau,x,y)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land x\\in X\\land y\\in X\\land x\\neq y\\land\\exists U\\in\\tau\\;\\exists V\\in\\tau\\;(x\\in U\\land y\\in V\\land U\\cap V=\\emptyset)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is the local separation relation for one ordered pair of distinct points; quantifying it over all such pairs yields Hausdorffness.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"74086485fba8d86f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"74086485fba8d86f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S$ (topological-space predicate, see [[../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\tau,x,y,U,V\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo10HausdorffPairSeparation}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo10\\text{-}hausdorff\\text{-}pair\\text{-}separation} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTopo10HausdorffPairSeparation}_S(X,\\tau,x,y)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land x\\in X\\land y\\in X\\land x\\neq y\\land\\exists U\\in\\tau\\;\\exists V\\in\\tau\\;(x\\in U\\land y\\in V\\land U\\cap V=\\emptyset)","display":true}],"bytes":1154,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3660","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-topo10-hausdorff-pair-separation.md|58-df-zfc-topo10-hausdorff-pair-separation]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["74086485fba8d86f"]}